        // protocol uses -request.id until payment creates the real picking.
        // Keep the signed identity intact so old durable records remain
        // replayable and cannot collide with a real picking.
        Number.isSafeInteger(Number(op.pickingId)) && Number(op.pickingId) !== 0;
